WEBVTT

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.580
Doesn't seem like the Earth Dragon
came through here, either.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.330
Sure doesn't.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.750
That was a strange sort of breeze.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.670
Probably blew in from Delight Canyon.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.330
Delight Canyon?

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.080
Yuji, we can see it from here.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.670
It's also known as the Valley of the Wind.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.790
Every now and then a burst of wind like that
comes rushing down the mountains.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.130
Old tales that claim it's the Earth Dragon's breath,
but I'd say that's unlikely.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.210
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.380
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.540
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.880
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:26.750
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:32.500
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:38.670
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:44.420
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.710
Oshikonde futa shite

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.460
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:55.250
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:01.750
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:05.460
Tsugi wa kimi no ban da

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.290
Tachimukaeyo monster

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.750
Nothing here.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.420
Or here!

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.960
Not seeing anything!

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:22.540
No, huh? All right.

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:27.170
Doesn't seem like my slimes
have found the Earth Dragon yet, either.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.290
I'm sure that team of yours will find it eventually.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:36.670
Yeah, after they took down those bandits,
I'm ready to believe they can do anything!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.540
Sounds like they're really overestimating my abilities.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.210
It's just like back when...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.960
Today you all will undergo
your Adventurer Registration Examination!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.790
To begin we will size up your magic abilities.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.540
What does this mean, then?

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:04.920
This can't be...

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.790
Next is a combat test.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.920
Use your best magic on this here boulder.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.250
My "best," huh?

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.080
Guess I ought to use the fireball I've gotten the hang of.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.130
That's that, I guess.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.210
Hold on a moment, Yuji...

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.080
What did I mess up now?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:42.420
Even looking past your wand-less, unusually
powered blast, what happened to your incantation?

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.960
You mean shouting "Fireball" or something?

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:51.540
Exactly. Silent spells are a high level magic
and typically weaken the cast spell.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.250
I see. Thanks for the info.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.210
Can I try that again?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.170
Guess that's what was unusual about it.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.920
Must have been too weak
because I didn't say the incantation.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.080
Fireball.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.000
Can I ask something?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.250
Better search for a weaker spell.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Magic Skills</b>

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Wind Magic</b>

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Fire Magic</b>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Tamer Skills</b>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Area of Effect</b>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.630
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>Tamer Skills</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>Area of Effect</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>Magic Limiter</b>

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:35.210
This should do it. A spell to limit my magic output.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.670
Might as well test it out.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.040
Spell Transfer - Rock Shot.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.920
Got 'em!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.920
Spell Transfer - Water Cannon.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.920
Yay!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.080
Spell Transfer - Wind Slicer.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.670
At our best as always!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.000
Spell Transfer - Ember.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.210
Another ready to go!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.630
Guess even weaker magic comes in handy.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.330
Hey...

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.880
Do you feel like something's off?

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.130
How so?

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.420
There should be more monsters around here.

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:11.750
You can never just walk through here untouched like this.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.080
I mean, my slimes have been taking care of any they find.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.040
All alone?!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:20.960
How strong are those slimes
if they can take down the creatures out here?!

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.920
Guess I went a little overboard again.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.880
Please don't tell me your slimes did this, too.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.130
No, this wasn't me.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.080
What do these skies mean?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.460
Father Steyl.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:47.830
Yuji!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.670
Find something?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.500
No sign of any monsters, but something feels weird.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.880
Yeah, this is just creepy!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.790
Know what this could well mean?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.630
We'll go take a look!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.750
Be careful.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:10.420
Branch Chief Rayard, are you aware
what that blue moon foretells?

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.170
I'm afraid not.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.080
"Calamity comes beneath the blue moon."

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.750
Such has been said since long ago.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.130
Do you mean to say we face coming disaster?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.710
What is this tome?

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:26.210
A book of legends.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.420
Everyone, vacate the area.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.920
Proud Wolf. Round up the slimes.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.380
On it!

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:03.670
What happened?

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.960
It's light out again!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.750
A huge dragon just appeared one kilometer to our rear.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.000
Is it the Earth Dragon?

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.580
I doubt it. This one's much bigger.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.080
Looks even stronger than the Earth Dragon.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.830
Seriously?!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.960
If that's true, we're talking something catastrophic.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.080
Shouldn't we head for safety?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.380
Let's fall back. Follow me!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:31.420
Won't we be trapped in here if we run into any monsters?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:36.290
We'll be okay. Delight Canyon
is known as a safe zone around here.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:40.210
Those gusts of winds seem to keep them away.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:45.380
Yeah, there haven't been reports of tough monsters
'round here for a hundred years.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:49.830
Proud Wolf, I want you running up ahead
to keep a look out just in case.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.420
Got it!

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.460
Spell Transfer - Ember.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.420
You little fellas never cease to impress!

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:15.210
It's gonna blow us away!

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:17.830
You slimes hang on tight!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.750
What WAS that?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.880
Oh! Maybe it was that.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.580
Indeed. The wind seems significantly stronger there.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.750
We better tell Yuji!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.580
All right! Let's get back to it and hit the road!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.630
Once we make it to the other side we'll reach Kilia.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.580
Let's pick up the pace.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.250
What's all this?

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.420
I sent my slimes ahead to take care of them.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.210
They did all this?!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:05.330
Your slimes really pack a punch.

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.210
Glad we can count on you!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.830
This is too much for me!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.290
Just stay calm!

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:15.750
Have you taken a look at that thing?!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.710
Ugh, we never can count on you, can we?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.540
You guys sure are something.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.500
Yuji's the one doing the work, though.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.670
Wait, where are we?

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:38.130
Oh! I guess we made our way through Delight Canyon.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:43.130
Yuji! We cleaned up all the monsters in the canyon.

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:44.790
You did? Okay then.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.040
What's that?!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:59.710
Makes sense. Hiding underground
means the wind is no bother.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.750
We should have guessed...

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.210
It's the Earth Dragon!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.750
Get behind those rocks!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.960
Yuji! Hurry! Over here!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:25.290
I'm going to try and attack.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:29.580
Are you crazy?! There's no way you stand a chance!

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.500
Let's start off with some weaker magic.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.750
Spell Transfer - Rock Shot.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.040
Spell Transfer - Ember.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.500
How thick are those scales?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.420
Maybe something a little stronger.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Skills</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Wind Magic</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Support Magic</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Sage Skills</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Fire Magic</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Ranged Attacks</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Holy Magic</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Fire Magic Blast</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Hellfire of Decimation</b>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Hellfire of Demise</b>

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Fire Barrier</b>

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>Ember</b>

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.500
Rather not make too much of a scene, though.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.880
Spell Transfer - Rock Shot.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:14.880
Thanks for that!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.210
Okay, everyone...

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.920
Spell Transfer - Rock Shot.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.920
What is he doing?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.540
That's never going to...

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.540
Yuji!

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.500
Ahh! It's that crazy wind again!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.330
It's kicking up a dust storm!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:01.710
Looks like that worked.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.130
Anyone have eyes on the Earth Dragon?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.080
It's right in front of me.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.130
Spell Transfer - Illumination.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.250
<b>Skills</b>

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.250
<b>Fire Magic Hellfire of Decimation</b>

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.790
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.420
What's happening?!

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.170
Yuji!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.380
You're safe!

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:43.040
We beat the Earth Dragon.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:45.830
You really did it...

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.960
But how?

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:53.250
Did you use the slimes to ignite the ores buried here?

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.250
Hmm?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.540
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:01.290
This canyon is full of ores that can be used as fuel,
buried just below the surface.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.630
You picked up on that and set them off, didn't you?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.670
Right, yeah, probably that.

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.880
Wow! You're really something!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:17.880
Welcome back.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:23.330
Um, your team was out
to investigate the Earth Dragon, yes?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.790
It was at first, yeah.

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.920
But we defeated it.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.330
Out in Delight Canyon.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:33.420
Lovely. You beat it out in Delight Canyon, hmm?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.420
W-wait, you WHAT?!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.920
You beat the Earth Dragon?!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.290
Is that the Earth Dragon's skull?

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.880
Like I said.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.790
Wait, what happened to Rodis?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.580
What? From Delight Canyon?

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.630
Wow!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.630
You're giving us this much?!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:06.920
Combined with the bounty on the Gelios Gang,
your total is 14,070,000 chicol.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:11.710
I must say I'm surprised you defeated the dragon.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.960
It wasn't easy!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.960
Yuji did most of the work, though.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.960
We need to talk.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.790
I've gathered you here to discuss
how to handle the Blue Dragon of Delight.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:37.630
Guess that's what they're calling it now.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:42.630
Before we begin, there's one important
piece of information I wish to share with you all.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:48.790
This feels like finding a critical error just before
we were expected to make a delivery at work.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.170
I've brought a member of the party who just returned
from Delight Canyon here to join us.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.210
It seems he saw the dragon himself.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:02.290
Yuji, can you give us a detailed description
of this dragon you witnessed?

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:03.710
Right...

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.080
Detailed how?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.580
Hang on...

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.710
<b>Holy Magic</b>

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.710
<b>Support Magic</b>

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.710
<b>Tamer Skills</b>

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.710
<b>Thoughtography</b>

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.920
This should do it.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:16.250
Spell Transfer - Thoughtography.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.040
This is an image of the dragon.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.750
The detail!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.130
I don't believe it...

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.750
What an incredible slime...

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:29.750
It's exactly like the one we found.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:30.670
What do you mean?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:34.250
Father, could you share what you know?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.960
Lend me your eyes.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.500
This is a book of legends.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.580
There are portions lost and missing,
and we've yet to unravel all its mysteries,

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.000
but there is an entry on that very same dragon.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.540
What does it say about it?

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.330
It states the dragon appeared
and grew under darkened skies,

00:15:55.330 --> 00:16:00.130
and within three days it wiped out an entire continent.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.420
In just three days?!

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:06.500
This is no catastrophic level monster!
This is the stuff of legends!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.250
I, myself do not want to believe it true.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.710
How was it defeated in the legend?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:15.580
If we have record of it,
that must mean someone survived.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:20.960
A divine emissary with powers to rival the gods
is said to have defeated the beast.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.040
But...

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:30.170
A divine emissary? We can't expect
to find someone like that in this day and age.

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:36.540
Wait, I think I might know why this dragon
has descended in the first place.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:42.080
30 years ago, when the sun climbed
to the highest height of the summer solstice,

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.290
and the moon eclipsed the sun and two became one...

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:51.710
...a ritual was carried out in the capital's grand cathedral.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:59.750
That ritual was meant to take effect 30 years from then.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.710
Roughly one week ago today.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:06.040
The Spirit Summoning Ceremony, yes.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:13.920
Much like you say, it was meant to summon
a spirit one week ago now to ward off coming calamity.

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:17.000
But unfortunately we have no sign it was successful.

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:22.500
Could that ritual have drawn out this dragon?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.540
There should be no reason to believe as such, yet...

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.960
Hey, it's getting dark out again!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:30.000
What's happening?!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.380
What was that?!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.420
Yuji! Yuji!

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:39.750
That blue dragon just got a whole lot bigger!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:42.580
And now it's back?

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.040
What was all that?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.580
I had slimes monitoring the dragon.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:51.290
The darkened sky was likely related
to the dragon's sudden increase in size.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.920
It's even bigger now?!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.670
"The dragon appears and grows under darkened skies."

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:03.040
Are you saying the end of the world
is now three days away?!

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.500
This is an emergency situation!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:13.580
Our foe may be the stuff of legend,
but we cannot sit by and merely await death!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.630
At first light, we hit the dragon with all we have!

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:20.500
This is so yummy!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.330
Especially after a hard day's work.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.330
We used so much magic!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.130
And fought treacherous foes, too.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.460
We're hard workers, right, Yuji?

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.170
Yuji!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.920
Tina. Lisa.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.920
Finally found you!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.500
You're going to face that blue dragon, right?

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.750
We joined the squad to fight it, too.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.500
They're paying a bonus for this one,
so we're gonna be rich!

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.210
We'll be fine as long as you're with us.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.790
There's nothing to be afraid of
with you and your slimes around.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.500
Yup! We can always count on you!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.830
We'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.080
Nighty-night!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.500
My apologies for the belated introduction.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:13.130
I am Father Steyl. I hail from
the Grand Cathedral in Central.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.250
I'm Yuji, Adventurer. What do you need from me?

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.790
There is something I wish to bestow upon you.

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:23.830
Apologies for the wait.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:29.250
Guided by the divine,
I brought this with me from the capital.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:36.710
It shames me to admit none of us clergy
could ascertain the value of this relic.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:40.790
However, I believe you may find use for it.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>Unbreakable</b>

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>Blessed</b>

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>Dagger of Kethis</b>

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>A dagger of unknown origins.</b>

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>Focuses the wielder's magic abilities</b>

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.750
<b>at the tip of its blade.</b>

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.290
The Dagger of Kethis.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.750
<b>Dagger of Kethis</b>

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.750
<b>A dagger of unknown origins.</b>

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.750
<b>Focuses the wielder's magic</b>

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.750
<b>abilities at the tip of its blade.</b>

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:52.080
It focuses magic effects, huh?

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.460
Right. I think I understand.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.580
Then the dagger is now yours.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.330
Why me?

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.790
Because the divine have deemed it so.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:15.540
Johann, let us pray together.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:37.830
Once morning comes, the team from Kilia
will head out to face that dragon.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.670
It'll be a battle that takes lots of lives.

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.210
Yuji!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.210
What happened?

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.250
It's getting even bigger!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.040
Can I ask something?

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:20.830
When you say my magic is "unusually powered,"
you mean unusually weak, right?

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:26.210
I meant it's too strong!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.290
Guess I can try.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:40.250
<b>EPISODE 3</b>

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:40.250
<b>I MEANT TOO STRONG</b>

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.960
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:46.000
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:47.380
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.290
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:52.460
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:53.960
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.420
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"

00:21:55.420 --> 00:22:00.540
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.630
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:59.250
"Sonnano attakke?"

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.540
"Niigerun da yo!"

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:04.750
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:10.170
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:18.040
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:19.460
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:20.630
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:23.540
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.540
Happadayo!

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:26.540
"Itadaitokimashou!"

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:28.880
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:35.380
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.130
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:41.130
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:46.170
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:51.330
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:54.420
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:55.830
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:57.210
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:58.630
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:01.420
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:04.040
CHEST!

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.540
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.880
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:13.380
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.250
Yay! We're gonna do a preview!

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:19.130
Whoa now! Check out this crazy dragon! This is bad!

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:20.580
Is Yuji gonna be okay?

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:22.580
He'll figure something out! And we're gonna help!

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:26.710
Still, things have been weird lately, huh?

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:28.080
Like the sky!

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:29.500
Or the people we meet!

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:32.920
Everything's so weird even we're getting weirder!

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>TRULY UNUSUAL SITUATIONS</b>

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:35.040
"Truly unusual situations!"

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:37.830
But I'm actually kinda excited!
